  "description": "KLM Cargo paint on the Martinair-operated 747-400ERFs: KLM blue over the whole fuselage, nose and tail cone included, a white belly under a thin dark-blue line; a huge white 'CARGO' in squared stencil-cut capitals over the forward main deck, the small KLM crown, 'KLM' and 'Royal Dutch Airlines' in white ahead of it, and 'Operated by Martinair' small on the white belly by the nose. White fin with the blue crown, a big blue 'KLM' and 'CARGO' under it; pale gray engines with the blue KLM logo; white winglets with 'KLM CARGO'.",
