      "accessed": "2026-11-20",
      "note": "747-406ERF PH-CKB, right side from above, side-on, at Hong Kong, 2025-11-22. Flipped and fitted to shapes/B744.json (no doors clear: nose, tail, fin tip, crown and belly pinned): the belly line, the fuselage titles' ends and heights, the fin's crown, 'KLM' and gray 'CARGO'."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:KLM_Cargo_PH-CKA_run_MP9462(Hong_Kong_International_Airport_to_United_Arab_Emirates_Dubai_Al_Maktoum_International_Airport)_12-01-2025.jpg",
      "title": "KLM Cargo PH-CKA run MP9462 (Hong Kong to Dubai Al Maktoum) 12-01-2025.jpg (CC BY-SA 4.0, LN9267)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-20",
      "note": "PH-CKA, left side from above at Hong Kong, 2025-01-12: on the left 'KLM' leads 'Royal Dutch Airlines', then 'CARGO'; 'Operated by Martinair' with the red chevron on the white below the forward door; the winglet's 'KLM CARGO'; PH-CKA's fin 'CARGO' is blue. Too foreshortened to fit closely: proportions read off it and matched to the right side's stretch."
    },
